Track 3: The Diver's Last Supper
- Story & Context: Legends now claim that the entire crew of the first cable-repair mission vanished during their final feast of tinned rations and sea-salt, leaving nothing behind but an endless playback loop echoing through the Mediterranean cables. Scholars visit the empty bay where they once sat, hearing the phantom rhythmic clatter of metal cutlery against ceramic, an eerie sound-relic that marks their transition into myth. The final hook lingers as an eternal haunting of the ocean floor, "Eat the static until the waves forget your name."
